Comment: The binary statically links libghostty-vt 1.0.1 (MIT, stable C ABI).
 Copyright 2024 Mitchell Hashimoto and the Ghostty contributors.
 That source is fetched at build time from the URLs and SHA256 pins in
 third_party/ghostty-vt.pins. It is not shipped as files in this source
 package. Zig 0.17.1, used only to compile the library, is fetched the
 same way and is not linked into the package.

